Default Icon Pack
=================

The SVG icons in this directory are simple geometric placeholders shipped with
gitter as the bundled default icon pack. They are licensed under the same terms
as gitter itself (GNU General Public License, version 3 or later).

Users may install third-party icon packs (such as the Material Icon Theme) into
%APPDATA%/Gitter/icon-packs/<pack-name>/ — those packs ship under their own
license terms (typically MIT) and gitter does not bundle them.
